Name Rio Note - Misc #1 Moving

Interactability_Text_Line_0 It has been nice living in Rio, but it is time I move to São Paulo. Almost everyone in my family lives there, I am one of the few in our family that still lives around here... even my grandma lives in São Paulo!
Interactability_Text_Line_1 I've also got some interesting job opportunities around there already, which means that I wont be jobless, which is good. There is even this security job at an Angel-something which seens interesting, I've heard that they pay very well for people good at shooting.